    <string name="diag_glass_warn_title">Probe the windows?</string>
    <string name="diag_glass_warn">The driver window will open and close on its own, several times, over about a minute.\n\nCheck first: nobody has a hand or an arm on the glass, no animal, no child, and no rain. The car must stay stopped with the ignition on — the probe stops itself if it starts moving.\n\nNothing else can settle which command moves the glass: the service accepts every value and reports success either way.</string>
